  "turns": [
    {
      "text": "Hello everyone, so I had a thought in mind that whenever I wanna do a stakeholder presentation of an idea, a flow, I can't write as fast as I'm thinking. [[slnc 1000]] And normally we'd have to wait or my drawing would be too ugly to revise or to share with others after it. [[slnc 1000]] So I thought that right now AI can work as fast and optimize for us that fast too, so we could visualize our thoughts, the same that we explain the flows. [[slnc 1000]] So this is what I built. [[slnc 1000]] It's a canvas first, listens to you with OpenAI API for GPT Transcribe, and it is something you can share your screen during a meeting while you're discussing and presenting your ideas, [[slnc 1000]] and then the app, the Sprig app, will right there visualize it. [[slnc 1000]] Thank you.",
